    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coldwake</strong> is a text-driven mystery set in the icy aftermath of a global collapse. Armed with nothing but an old terminal and your curiosity, you\u2019ll dig through corrupted logs, hidden directories, and fragmented memories buried in a forgotten facility. Every command you type is a key\u2014one that might unlock a lost file, a piece of a shattered mind, or a chilling secret about what really happened beneath the snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coldwake is heavily based on reading.</strong> The story unfolds entirely through written logs, system messages, journal entries, and memory fragments. You won\u2019t just read the story\u2014you\u2019ll reconstruct it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main tool is the terminal.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type commands</strong> to uncover files and unlock hidden content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate a retro-futuristic OS</strong>.\u00a0Every file tells a piece of the story. Some lie. Some beg to be found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate</strong> logs, system errors, and encrypted messages to piece together what happened.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve narrative puzzles</strong> by noticing details, keywords, and terminal responses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recover the fragments</strong> of a lost consciousness scattered across a dying system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coldwake</strong> blends interactive fiction, emotional sci-fi, and immersive investigation. It\u2019s quiet, nonlinear, and rewards players who read carefully, think deeply, and follow the threads others might miss.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coldwake</strong> is a text-driven mystery set in the icy aftermath of a global collapse. Armed with nothing but an old terminal and your curiosity, you\u2019ll dig through corrupted logs, hidden directories, and fragmented memories buried in a forgotten facility. Every command you type is a key\u2014one that might unlock a lost file, a piece of a shattered mind, or a chilling secret about what really happened beneath the snow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coldwake is heavily based on reading.</strong> The story unfolds entirely through written logs, system messages, journal entries, and memory fragments. You won\u2019t just read the story\u2014you\u2019ll reconstruct it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main tool is the terminal.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type commands</strong> to uncover files and unlock hidden content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate a retro-futuristic OS</strong>.\u00a0Every file tells a piece of the story. Some lie. Some beg to be found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate</strong> logs, system errors, and encrypted messages to piece together what happened.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve narrative puzzles</strong> by noticing details, keywords, and terminal responses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recover the fragments</strong> of a lost consciousness scattered across a dying system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coldwake</strong> blends interactive fiction, emotional sci-fi, and immersive investigation. It\u2019s quiet, nonlinear, and rewards players who read carefully, think deeply, and follow the threads others might miss.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore an abandoned facility in this narrative-driven terminal adventure. Unlock hidden files, solve text-based puzzles, and piece together a fragmented AI as you uncover the truth behind a failed salvation and a buried past in this cold, atmospheric mystery.",
